        "original_id": "dc154a10-9bb1-5748-86f1-608bd21823b6",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Charles Blake\n- Organizations: 34th (Cumberland) Regiment of Foot, 55th (Westmorland) Regiment of Foot, Border Regiment\n- Roles: British army surgeon\n- Events: Childers Reforms, force sent to fight the Americans\n\nFacts:\n- Charles Blake was born on 13 August 1746 and died on 22 April 1810.\n- Charles Blake was a British army surgeon with the 34th Foot Regiment in the force sent to fight the Americans.\n- In 1881, under the Childers Reforms, the 34th (Cumberland) Regiment of Foot amalgamated with the 55th (Westmorland) Regiment of Foot to form the Border Regiment.",
